# Copy to .githooks/blocked-terms — that path is gitignored on purpose.
#
# One extended-regexp pattern per line, matched case-insensitively against the
# staged diff. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Use it for names that must never appear in a public commit: clients under
# NDA, employers, prospects, anything that belongs in notes/ rather than docs/.
#
# example-client
# some former employer
